{"slug":"q-ss-r","ar":"ق ص ر","total":11,"core":"shortening; restraining; palace","forms":[{"ar":"قَصْر","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":4,"gloss":"Palace","word":"qasr","ex":{"s":77,"a":32,"p":4,"ar":["إِنَّهَا","تَرْمِى","بِشَرَرٍ","كَٱلْقَصْرِ"],"en":"Indeed, it throws sparks [as huge] as a fortress"}},{"ar":"قَٰصِرَٰت","kind":"active participle","form":null,"count":3,"gloss":"of restrained gaze","word":null,"ex":{"s":37,"a":48,"p":2,"ar":["وَعِندَهُمْ","قَـٰصِرَٰتُ","ٱلطَّرْفِ","عِينٌ"],"en":"And with them will be women limiting [their] glances, with large, [beautiful] eyes"}},{"ar":"مُقَصِّرِين","kind":"active participle","form":2,"count":1,"gloss":"shortening hair","word":null,"ex":{"s":48,"a":27,"p":16,"ar":["لَّقَدْ","صَدَقَ","ٱللَّهُ","رَسُولَهُ","ٱلرُّءْيَا","بِٱلْحَقِّ ۖ","لَتَدْخُلُنَّ","ٱلْمَسْجِدَ","ٱلْحَرَامَ","إِن","شَآءَ","ٱللَّهُ","ءَامِنِينَ","مُحَلِّقِينَ","رُءُوسَكُمْ","وَمُقَصِّرِينَ","لَا","تَخَافُونَ ۖ","فَعَلِمَ","مَا","لَمْ","تَعْلَمُوا۟","فَجَعَلَ","مِن","دُونِ","ذَٰلِكَ","فَتْحًا","قَرِيبًا"],"en":"Certainly has Allah showed to His Messenger the vision in truth. You will surely enter al-Masjid al-Haram, if Allah wills, in safety, with your heads shaved and [hair] shortened, not fearing [anyone]. He knew what you did not know and has arranged before that a conquest near [at hand]"}},{"ar":"مَّقْصُورَٰت","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"secluded, restrained","word":null,"ex":{"s":55,"a":72,"p":2,"ar":["حُورٌ","مَّقْصُورَٰتٌ","فِى","ٱلْخِيَامِ"],"en":"Fair ones reserved in pavilions"}},{"ar":"تَقْصُرُ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":1,"gloss":"to shorten","word":null,"ex":{"s":4,"a":101,"p":9,"ar":["وَإِذَا","ضَرَبْتُمْ","فِى","ٱلْأَرْضِ","فَلَيْسَ","عَلَيْكُمْ","جُنَاحٌ","أَن","تَقْصُرُوا۟","مِنَ","ٱلصَّلَوٰةِ","إِنْ","خِفْتُمْ","أَن","يَفْتِنَكُمُ","ٱلَّذِينَ","كَفَرُوٓا۟ ۚ","إِنَّ","ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","كَانُوا۟","لَكُمْ","عَدُوًّا","مُّبِينًا"],"en":"And when you travel throughout the land, there is no blame upon you for shortening the prayer, [especially] if you fear that those who disbelieve may disrupt [or attack] you. Indeed, the disbelievers are ever to you a clear enemy"}},{"ar":"يُقْصِرُ","kind":"verb","form":4,"count":1,"gloss":"to cease, stop short","word":null,"ex":{"s":7,"a":202,"p":7,"ar":["وَإِخْوَٰنُهُمْ","يَمُدُّونَهُمْ","فِى","ٱلْغَىِّ","ثُمَّ","لَا","يُقْصِرُونَ"],"en":"But their brothers - the devils increase them in error; then they do not stop short"}}],"surahs":[[7,2],[55,2],[4,1],[22,1],[25,1],[37,1],[38,1],[48,1],[77,1]]}